=== SOURCE.md ===
# pasta — third-party binary licence and corresponding source notice

This ACOS installation ships the unmodified upstream `pasta` static binary at
`libexec/pasta` for the optional `network:real` module (ADR-0030). `pasta` is a
separate standalone executable invoked by `acos-netd` and is never linked into
any ACOS binary (ACOS itself is licensed under Apache-2.0).

## Provenance and build

- **Project:** passt / pasta (Plug A Simple Socket Transport)
- **Upstream repository:** https://passt.top/passt
- **Pinned release tag:** `2026_10_02.cba3570`
- **Upstream commit:** `cba357068dc586e7540971eb40bb56c5e62c4de1 (2026-09-28)`
- **Upstream modifications:** none (unmodified upstream source at tag `2026_10_02.cba3570`)
- **Installed binary:** `libexec/pasta`
- **Binary size:** 1548232 bytes
- **Binary SHA-256:** `314c37e878bd6ffe43200735800d5efd4859d81d46b0450358a103c36c0edf60`
- **Build command:** `make clean && make static -j8 VERSION=2026_10_02.cba3570`
- **Reference build compiler:** `gcc (GCC) 16.2.1 20260810`

Reproduce from upstream source:

```bash
git clone --depth 1 -b 2026_10_02.cba3570 https://passt.top/passt pasta-src
make -C pasta-src static VERSION=2026_10_02.cba3570
```

## Licences

- **GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (`GPL-2.0-or-later`):**
  full verbatim upstream licence text installed alongside this notice at
  `share/doc/acos/pasta/COPYING` (upstream `LICENSES/GPL-2.0-or-later.txt`).
- **BSD-3-Clause** (bundled compat/siphash components in upstream passt):
  installed alongside this notice at `share/doc/acos/pasta/BSD-3-Clause.txt` when
  present (upstream `LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt`).

## Corresponding Source and GPL-2.0 Section 3 Written Offer

The complete, unmodified corresponding source code for this `pasta` binary is
publicly available from upstream Git at https://passt.top/passt (tag `2026_10_02.cba3570`, commit
`cba357068dc586e7540971eb40bb56c5e62c4de1 (2026-09-28)`).

In accordance with Section 3(b) of the GNU General Public License, version 2,
for at least three (3) years from the date you received this binary, you may
also obtain a complete machine-readable copy of the corresponding source code
for this exact `pasta` build (tag `2026_10_02.cba3570`, commit `cba357068dc586e7540971eb40bb56c5e62c4de1 (2026-09-28)`) at no
